---
layout: default
title: Projects
description: Products, platforms, brands, and experiments shipped by Nikolay Ostrovsky.
page_class: projects-page
---

{% projects = collections.projects.resources.sort_by { |project| project.data.order } %}
{% selected = projects.reject { |project| project.data.group == "archive" } %}
{% archive = projects.select { |project| project.data.group == "archive" } %}
{% clean_text = ->(value) { value.to_s.gsub(/[—–]/, "-") } %}
<div class="mx-auto w-[min(1180px,calc(100%-2rem))]">
  <section class="grid gap-10 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_.5fr] md:items-end md:gap-20 md:py-32">
    <h1 class="max-w-[12ch] text-[clamp(3.6rem,10vw,6rem)] font-black leading-[.88] tracking-[-.04em]">Things I’ve <strong class="text-fire">shipped.</strong></h1>
    <div>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-black">{{ projects.size }} products, systems, brands, and experiments</p>
      <p class="max-w-[34ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Two decades across product, engineering, design, and the occasional business built from zero.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-20">
    <div class="mb-7 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4 border-b border-line">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-.03em] md:text-5xl">Selected work</h2>
      <span class="mb-3 w-full text-sm text-muted md:w-auto">Products · systems · brands · experiments</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-3 md:grid-cols-12">
      {% selected.each_with_index do |project, index| %}
        <article class="project-card {{ index < 6 ? 'md:col-span-6' : 'md:col-span-4' }}">
          <a href="{{ project.relative_url }}" class="block text-inherit">
            <figure class="project-media {{ project.data.logo && !project.data.coverVideo && 'project-logo' }} relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-white">
              {%@ "project_media", project: project, loading: (index < 4 ? "eager" : "lazy") %}
            </figure>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-2 border-b border-line py-5">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-black tracking-[-.02em] md:text-2xl">{{ project.data.name }}</h3>
              <p class="col-span-2 max-w-[46ch] leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ clean_text.call(project.data.summary) }}</p>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>
      {% end %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-16 md:pb-28">
    <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4 border-b border-line">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-.03em] md:text-5xl">Archive</h2>
      <span class="mb-3 w-full text-sm text-muted md:w-auto">The sites may be gone. The work stays.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-x-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% archive.each do |project| %}
        <a href="{{ project.relative_url }}" class="block border-b border-line py-4 text-inherit">
          <strong class="block">{{ project.data.name }}</strong>
          <small class="mt-1 block leading-snug text-muted">{{ clean_text.call(project.data.summary) }}</small>
        </a>
      {% end %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
